cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pycalphad in your research, please cite the article in preferred-citation."
title: pycalphad
type: software
abstract: >-
  pycalphad is a free and open-source Python library for designing thermodynamic models, calculating phase
  diagrams and investigating phase equilibria within the CALPHAD method.
authors:
  - family-names: Otis
    given-names: Richard
  - family-names: Bocklund
    given-names: Brandon
